# Allowlist for the public ConGen evaluation artifact.
#
# ALLOWLIST, NEVER A BLOCKLIST. A blocklist fails silently on the file nobody thought
# of; this project has proved that four times -- apps/conf/run_conmin_config.toml and
# tests/test_make_tables.py matched no path filter anyone wrote, and one of them was
# live in the working tree. An allowlist fails loudly instead: the omitted file is
# simply absent, and reproduce_tables_sosym.sh stops.
#
# Each line is a path prefix relative to the repository root, matched against
# `git ls-files`. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# What this CANNOT do: remove a function from a file that is kept. Those are content
# edits and live as named patches in release/patches/ -- see release/carve.sh. An
# allowlist that silently also edited files would be the hand-editing it replaces.

